  "description": "A command line and Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool for Lumoin.Veridical: BLAKE3 hashing, platform/backend information, and a self-test that runs known-answer conformance vectors (field arithmetic, the SIMD batch multiply, and hashing). The same operations are exposed as MCP tools.",
  "iconFile": "resources/lumoin-veridical-nuget-logo.png",
  "id": "Lumoin.Veridical.Cli.any",
  "isPrerelease": false,
